{"result":"{
  "id": "18554",
  "key": "SFCC-277",
  "summary": "Cart - Empty Cart State: Component Render Order & Logic",
  "description": "As a Shopper, I want to see a helpful message when my cart is empty, so that I understand the bag is empty and am guided toward browsing or contacting support.\n\nThis story covers the logic of when the empty cart state is triggered and the render order of all components within the cart drawer when the basket contains no items. It does not cover the build of any individual component — each has its own dedicated story.\n\nThe empty cart state renders the following components in order:\n\n- Cart drawer panel and header — [SFCC-315](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-315)  \n- Client Services contact details and copy — fetched from Contentful\n- Recommended for You - [SFCC-815](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-815) \n- Zimmermann Benefits content — [SFCC-316](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-316) \n\n**Image for reference (Figma is leading):**\n\n![\"image-20260804-004155.png\"](image-20260804-004155.png)\n\n*Designs:* [https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann*Designs?node-id=4905-9719&t=G0lZeHVTCboPKNHs-0](https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann*Designs)",
